{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":15259,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T14:30:06+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:39:02+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-macbook-ultra-iphone-pieghevole-novita-in-arrivo\",\"title\":\"iOS 27, MacBook Ultra e iPhone pieghevole: le novità in arrivo\",\"excerpt\":\"Nuovi leak su Siri in iOS 27, rumor su un possibile “MacBook Ultra”, aggiornamenti su Apple Watch per il monitoraggio glicemico e prime indicazioni sull’iPhone pieghevole.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/top-stories-2026-05-30-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"top-stories-2026-05-30\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15253,\"date\":\"2026-06-01T12:00:38+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-31T22:38:48+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-apple-tv-4k-homepod-mini-quasi-pronti-siri-aggiornata-attesa\",\"title\":\"Nuovi Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini “quasi pronti”: Siri aggiornata attesa\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman, Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini sarebbero pronti da mesi, ma il lancio slitterebbe finché non arriva Siri più personalizzata.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/06/HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15230,\"date\":\"2026-05-30T17:30:24+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-29T23:24:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prime-beta-pubbliche-ios-26-6-macos-tahoe-26-6\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le prime beta pubbliche di iOS 26.6 e macOS Tahoe 26.6\",\"excerpt\":\"Disponibili le prime beta pubbliche di iOS 26.6, iPadOS 26.6, macOS Tahoe 26.6, watchOS 26.6 e tvOS 26.6. Arrivano due giorni dopo le beta per sviluppatori.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15154,\"date\":\"2026-05-27T18:30:49+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-27T16:30:49+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prime-beta-ios-26-6-ipados-26-6\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia le prime beta di iOS 26.6 e iPadOS 26.6\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha distribuito le prime beta di iOS 26.6 e iPadOS 26.6 agli sviluppatori. Il download avviene da Impostazioni > Generali > Aggiornamento software.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.6-Glass-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15123,\"date\":\"2026-05-24T15:13:28+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-24T13:13:28+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-prepara-genai-apple-com-in-vista-del-wwdc-2026\",\"title\":\"Apple prepara genai.apple.com in vista del WWDC 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Spunta il sottodominio genai.apple.com su DNS Apple, in anticipo sul WWDC 2026. Non risulta ancora collegato a una pagina attiva.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Intelligence-General-Feature-2-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Intelligence-General-Feature-2\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15100,\"date\":\"2026-05-23T16:30:50+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-23T16:00:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"wwdc-2026-siri-riprogettato-accessibilita-ios-27\",\"title\":\"WWDC 2026: Siri riprogettato e nuove funzioni di accessibilità in iOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple conferma WWDC 2026 (8-12 giugno). Attese novità su iOS 27, con un Siri ripensato, funzioni di accessibilità e aggiornamenti per iOS 27 e altri sistemi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/TMRS-195-WWDC-2026-Promises-Apple-Intelligence-and-Siri-Upgrades-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"TMRS-195-WWDC-2026-Promises-Apple-Intelligence-and-Siri-Upgrades-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15039,\"date\":\"2026-05-21T09:44:21+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-21T06:47:14+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-didascalie-automatiche-video-personali-iphone\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: didascalie automatiche per i video personali su iPhone\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple anticipa nuove funzioni di accessibilità: iOS 27 può generare automaticamente didascalie per i video personali, con supporto iniziale in inglese.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Says-iOS-27-Can-Automatically-Add-Captions-to-Your-Personal-iPhone-Videos-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Says-iOS-27-Can-Automatically-Add-Captions-to-Your-Personal-iPhone-Videos-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15037,\"date\":\"2026-05-21T08:30:11+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-21T06:46:46+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-voice-control-linguaggio-naturale-upgrade-apple-intelligence\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: Voice Control con linguaggio naturale e upgrade Apple Intelligence\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple aggiorna Voice Control su iPhone e iPad con supporto al linguaggio naturale tramite Apple Intelligence. Funzione disponibile inizialmente in inglese in alcuni Paesi.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-27s-New-AI-Voice-Control-Feature-Hints-at-Major-Siri-Upgrade-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27s-New-AI-Voice-Control-Feature-Hints-at-Major-Siri-Upgrade-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":15019,\"date\":\"2026-05-20T18:30:19+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-20T09:59:44+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-nuove-funzioni-accessibilita-apple-intelligence\",\"title\":\"Apple anticipa nuove funzioni di accessibilità con Apple Intelligence\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple annuncia aggiornamenti accessibilità basati su Apple Intelligence per VoiceOver, Magnifier, Voice Control e Accessibility Reader, con sottotitoli generati e controllo carrozzina su Vision Pro.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iOS-27-Accessibility-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-Accessibility-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14974,\"date\":\"2026-05-19T14:30:26+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-19T08:06:38+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-programma-wwdc-2026-inviti-media\",\"title\":\"Apple pubblica il programma di WWDC 2026 e invia inviti ai media\",\"excerpt\":\"WWDC 2026 si terrà dal 8 al 12 giugno. La keynote inizierà alle 10:00 PT (1:00 ET) e sarà disponibile in streaming su Apple.com, Apple TV e YouTube.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/wwdc-apple-park-in-person-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"wwdc-apple-park-in-person\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14970,\"date\":\"2026-05-19T12:00:06+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-19T08:05:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-espande-strumenti-scrittura-correttore-grammaticale-ios-27\",\"title\":\"Apple amplia gli strumenti di scrittura con un correttore grammaticale in iOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"In iOS 27 Apple sta testando Writing Tools più avanzati, con riscrittura e generazione di testo, oltre a un correttore grammaticale dedicato simile a Grammarly.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/apple-intelligence-black-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"apple-intelligence-black\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14896,\"date\":\"2026-05-15T10:45:34+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-15T06:53:16+00:00\",\"slug\":\"openai-valuta-azioni-legali-contro-apple-partnership-tesa-siri\",\"title\":\"OpenAI valuta azioni legali contro Apple per la partnership “tesa” con Siri\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, OpenAI starebbe valutando opzioni legali contro Apple per una partnership con Siri giudicata “tesa”, con integrazione e promozione ritenute insufficienti.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/OpenAI-vs-Apple-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"OpenAI-vs-Apple-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14778,\"date\":\"2026-05-12T14:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-12T07:57:42+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-26-5-piu-di-50-vulnerabilita-sicurezza\",\"title\":\"Aggiornamento iOS 26.5: più di 50 vulnerabilità di sicurezza corrette\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato iOS 26.5 e iPadOS 26.5 con oltre 50 correzioni di sicurezza. Nessun bug risulta sfruttato attivamente, ma è consigliato aggiornare.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/bug-security-vulnerability-issue-fix-larry-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"bug-security-vulnerability-issue-fix-larry\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14763,\"date\":\"2026-05-11T08:15:05+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-11T06:15:05+00:00\",\"slug\":\"macos-27-nuove-modifiche-design-organize-tabs\",\"title\":\"macOS 27: nuove modifiche al design e opzione “Organize Tabs”\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, macOS 27 avrà un leggero redesign rispetto a macOS Tahoe e una funzione AI in Safari per raggruppare automaticamente le schede.\",\"categoryName\":\"macOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"macos\",\"categoryId\":100,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/MacBook-Pro-Low-Angle-Wide-Lens-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"MacBook-Pro-Low-Angle-Wide-Lens\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14697,\"date\":\"2026-05-08T09:00:22+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-08T06:35:38+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-pro-fotocamere-ai-test-advanced-2\",\"title\":\"AirPods Pro con fotocamere AI: test “advanced” in corso\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, gli AirPods Pro con fotocamere integrate sono in fase di test “advanced”: design e feature set quasi definitivi, con possibile avvio della produzione iniziale.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/airpods-pro-3-orange-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-pro-3-orange\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14625,\"date\":\"2026-05-06T09:06:06+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-06T07:06:06+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-scegliere-claude-o-gemini-invece-di-chatgpt-apple-intelligence\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: come scegliere Claude o Gemini al posto di ChatGPT per Apple Intelligence\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, iOS 27, iPadOS 27 e macOS 27 permetteranno di impostare servizi AI di terze parti come predefiniti per le funzioni di Apple Intelligence.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Apple-Intelligence-General-Feature-2-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Intelligence-General-Feature-2\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14237,\"date\":\"2026-04-14T08:11:19+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-14T06:11:19+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-seconda-beta-ios-26-5-ipados-26-5\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la seconda beta di iOS 26.5 e iPadOS 26.5\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha distribuito agli sviluppatori la seconda beta di iOS 26.5 e iPadOS 26.5 per test. Le novità includono aggiornamenti su Maps, RCS e funzioni per wearables in UE.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/iOS-26.5-Glass-Feature-Warm-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.5-Glass-Feature-Warm\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14106,\"date\":\"2026-04-02T13:26:52+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-02T11:26:52+00:00\",\"slug\":\"siri-in-ios-27-tutto-quello-che-sappiamo\",\"title\":\"Siri in iOS 27: tutto quello che sappiamo (rumor)\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo i rumor, iOS 27, iPadOS 27 e macOS 27 introdurranno una Siri riprogettata come chatbot, con app dedicata, integrazione di sistema e nuove funzioni basate su Gemini.\",\"categoryName\":\"iOS\",\"categorySlug\":\"ios\",\"categoryId\":14,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/iOS-27-and-Siri-Finder-Thumb-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-and-Siri-Finder-Thumb\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14071,\"date\":\"2026-03-29T22:39:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-29T20:39:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-27-siri-app-extensions\",\"title\":\"iOS 27: Siri potrebbe arrivare come app con “Extensions”\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman, iOS 27, iPadOS 27 e macOS 27 potrebbero includere una nuova app di Siri con una funzione “Extensions” per integrare chatbot di terze parti.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/iOS-27-on-iPhone-17-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-27-on-iPhone-17-1\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14057,\"date\":\"2026-03-26T21:33:08+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-26T20:33:08+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-chatbot-ai-terze-parti-integrabili-con-siri-in-ios-27\",\"title\":\"Apple: chatbot AI di terze parti integrabili con Siri in iOS 27\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, Apple in iOS 27 permetterà l’integrazione di chatbot AI di terze parti con Siri, espandendo l’attuale collaborazione con OpenAI/ChatGPT.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/Gemini-Siri-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Gemini-Siri-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13793,\"date\":\"2026-03-10T00:04:04+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-12T20:08:23+00:00\",\"slug\":\"ios-26-4-beta-nuovi-emoji\",\"title\":\"L'ultima beta di iOS 26.4 aggiunge nuovi caratteri emoji\",\"excerpt\":\"La quarta beta di iOS 26.4, iPadOS 26.4 e macOS Tahoe 26.4 introduce nove nuovi caratteri emoji.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/Latest-iOS-26.4-Beta-Adds-New-Emoji-Characters-Feature-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Latest iOS Beta Adds New Emoji Characters Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":11,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":12860,\"date\":\"2026-01-30T21:11:08+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-01-30T20:11:08+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-rilasciato-settimana-gennaio-2026\",\"title\":\"Ecco Tutto Ciò che Apple ha Rilasciato Questa Settimana\",\"excerpt\":\"La settimana finale di gennaio è stata intensa per Apple, con nuovi AirTag, un nuovo Black Unity band per Apple Watch e il bundle Apple Creator Studio ora disponibile.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/01/imac-